---
permalink: ./ff14.html
title: 最终幻想XIV · 水晶星海
bodyClass: world-ff14 ff-world-home
pageType: ff14-home
worldId: ff14
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - worlds.css
  - ff14-world.css
  - responsive.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<article class="ff-portal" id="ff14-world" aria-labelledby="ff-world-title">
  <header class="ff-hero">
    <div class="ff-aether-sky" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ff-aether-ring ff-aether-ring--outer"></div>
      <div class="ff-aether-ring ff-aether-ring--inner"></div>
      <div class="ff-constellation-lines"></div>
      <svg class="ff-mothercrystal" viewBox="0 0 420 620" role="img">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="ff-crystal-main" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop stop-color="#f5fbff"/><stop offset=".32" stop-color="#a9dff2"/>
            <stop offset=".68" stop-color="#7d75d6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3c2b78"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="ff-crystal-side" x1="1" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop stop-color="#e0c5ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#34598c"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <filter id="ff-crystal-glow"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="16"/></filter>
        </defs>
        <path class="ff-crystal-aura" d="M210 24 362 230 298 520 210 596 119 520 58 230Z"/>
        <path fill="url(#ff-crystal-main)" d="M210 40 338 238 272 506 210 578 137 496 82 238Z"/>
        <path fill="url(#ff-crystal-side)" d="m210 40 128 198-128 91-128-91Z"/>
        <path class="ff-crystal-face" d="m210 40 62 466-62 72-73-82Z"/>
        <path class="ff-crystal-line" d="m82 238 128 91 128-91M137 496l73-167 62 177M210 40v538"/>
      </svg>
      {% for reflection in ff14Catalog.reflections %}
      <i class="ff-orbit-star ff-orbit-star--{{ loop.index }}"></i>
      {% endfor %}
      <span class="ff-aether-label ff-aether-label--one">AETHER CURRENT / STABLE</span>
      <span class="ff-aether-label ff-aether-label--two">THE SOURCE + XIII REFLECTIONS</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-hero-register" aria-label="最终幻想XIV档案状态">
      <span><i></i> ECHO RESONANCE / ACQUIRED</span>
      <span>ATS / WORLD-03 / ÆTHERIS</span>
      <span>PATCH {{ ff14Catalog.coverage.currentPatch }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-hero-copy">
      <p class="ff-eyebrow">FINAL FANTASY XIV / A CRYSTAL CALLS</p>
      <h1 id="ff-world-title"><span>最终幻想 XIV</span>水晶星海</h1>
      <p>水晶的回声在十四个世界间延展。你可以从历史、镜像世界或旅途进入，沿自己关心的方向阅读。</p>
      <div class="ff-hero-actions">
        <a href="./ff14-journeys.html?journey=dawntrail#dawntrail">继续当前旅途</a>
        <a href="#ff-archive-boundary">查看收录边界</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="ff-current-call" href="./ff14-journeys.html?journey=dawntrail#dawntrail">
      <span>CURRENT CALL / 7.5 PART 1</span>
      <strong>向天之路</strong>
      <p>自第九世界归来，围绕“钥匙”的调查仍在继续。</p>
      <i>回应水晶的呼唤 →</i>
    </a>
  </header>

  <nav class="ff-entry-grid" aria-label="最终幻想XIV探索方向">
    <a class="ff-entry ff-entry--chronicle" href="./ff14-chronicle.html">
      <span>01 / CRYSTAL CHRONICLE</span>
      <strong>星海编年</strong>
      <p>收录 {{ ff14Catalog.stats.records }} 条记录，涵盖古代世界、灵灾星历、主线长卷、秘话与设定索引。</p>
      <i>展开水晶长卷 →</i>
    </a>
    <a class="ff-entry ff-entry--reflections" href="./ff14-reflections.html">
      <span>02 / REFLECTION PRISM</span>
      <strong>镜界棱镜</strong>
      <p>查看原初世界与十三个镜像世界的已知记录；尚无可靠资料的世界暂不展开。</p>
      <i>校准十四面棱镜 →</i>
    </a>
    <a class="ff-entry ff-entry--journeys" href="./ff14-journeys.html">
      <span>03 / JOURNEY CONSTELLATION</span>
      <strong>旅途星座</strong>
      <p>沿八段冒险旅途，回看从旧艾欧泽亚到金曦之遗辉的地点、主题与时代转折。</p>
      <i>选择下一颗星 →</i>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <section class="ff-saga-boundary" aria-labelledby="ff-saga-title">
    <header>
      <span>ONE STAR / TWO GREAT MOVEMENTS</span>
      <h2 id="ff-saga-title">终章落幕，下一张地图展开</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="ff-saga-grid">
      <article>
        <span>1.x — 6.0</span>
        <h3>旧星长篇</h3>
        <p>海德林与佐迪亚克的篇章在《晓月之终途》6.0收束，旧长篇至此完结；此后的故事沿新的航路展开。</p>
        <a href="./ff14-journeys.html?journey=endwalker#endwalker">抵达终途 →</a>
      </article>
      <div class="ff-saga-crystal" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <article>
        <span>6.1 — 7.x / EDITORIAL ARC</span>
        <h3>终章之后</h3>
        <p>6.1 起，藏宝图的线索把旅程引向第十三世界。本站暂以“终章之后”标记这一阶段；官方尚未公布新篇章名称。</p>
        <a href="./ff14-journeys.html?journey=newfound#newfound">重新启程 →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-archive-boundary" id="ff-archive-boundary" aria-labelledby="ff-boundary-title">
    <div>
      <span>ARCHIVE ATTUNEMENT</span>
      <h2 id="ff-boundary-title">收录边界</h2>
      <p>{{ ff14Catalog.coverage.notice }}</p>
    </div>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>已收录记录</dt><dd>{{ ff14Catalog.stats.records }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>主编年</dt><dd>{{ ff14Catalog.stats.mainline }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>镜像记录</dt><dd>{{ ff14Catalog.stats.reflections }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>核验日期</dt><dd>{{ ff14Catalog.coverage.asOf }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="ff-boundary-sources">
      {% for source in ff14Catalog.coverage.sources %}
      <a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.title }} ↗</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </p>
  </section>
</article>
{% endblock %}
